Third-party data and services
=============================

AIT Alert Data Set (AIT-ADS)
----------------------------
Copyright: Max Landauer, Florian Skopik, Markus Wurzenberger / AIT Austrian
Institute of Technology.
Record: https://zenodo.org/records/8263181
DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.8263181
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).

This project downloads AIT-ADS from the original Zenodo record and does not
redistribute it. The project performs normalization, grouping, and derived
labeling. The GPL-3.0 scripts from the AIT alert-data-set repository are not
included or reused; the loader in this repository is an independent
implementation based on the public data format documentation.

Microsoft GUIDE is a stretch-goal dataset and is not redistributed here.
If enabled later, it must be attributed under CDLA-Permissive-2.0.

Threat-intelligence provider responses are subject to their provider terms and
must not be committed to this repository.
